    "detailed_description": "feeling like streaming but don't want to expose your IRL face? use ego to livestream as an avatar!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nego is built to make it as easy as possible for anyone to become a vtuber and stream as an avatar. We built a character creator and real-time face tracker allowing you to express yourself as the alter-ego of your choice!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nego is still WIP, so please send over any feedback or features you'd like to see!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n* A 3D rigged, anime style character creator for character customization <br />\r\n* Face tracking built in from any webcam or camera<br />\r\n* Custom video and Photo Backgrounds<br />\r\n* Stream mode<br />\r\n* Virtual camera built in",
